<title>USA: Met-Pro Corp Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Met-Pro Corp Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>HARLEYVSILLE, Pa. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1st Quarter Ended</p>
<p>							  April 30,</p>
<p>						    1997		1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			     $14,912,736	$13,731,982</p>
<p> Income Before Taxes		   2,780,929	  2,349,483</p>
<p> Provision for Income Taxes	  1,084,562	    928,046</p>
<p> Net Income for Period		 1,696,367	  1,421,437</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share (fully diluted)(A)   .24		  .20</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share are based on the average number of shares outstanding, fully diluted, of 7,149,331 on April 30, 1997, and 7,042,427 on April 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(A) Earnings per share for the period ended April 30, 1996, were adjusted to reflect the 3-for-2 stock split which occurred on July 8 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
